# gNewSense Evolution - Artwork & Graphics Licensing Directory

This directory houses the official visual assets, branding elements, and vector schemas for the **gNewSense Evolution (v5.0 / v5.0.1)** project. To respect the licensing history of Free Software, our graphical footprint uses a dual-logo configuration to showcase the complete timeline of the system's evolution.

---

