## 🛠️ Staging Directories for Web and System Developers

Web developers and system maintainers must reference these graphic paths directly when configuring project assets:

```text
my-gnewsense-git-repo/
└── artwork/
    ├── logos/
    │   ├── gnewsense-2006.png     # Vintage orange eye vector canvas
    │   └── gnewsense-2012.png     # Glossy blue/green sphere matrix
    └── wallpapers/
        └── desktop-default.png    # Pre-baked system workspace background file
```

### Display Manager Banner Injector Code
To display both historical logos side-by-side on your **SDDM** or **LightDM** login screen configurations, reference the shared vector path keys directly in your system style sheets:

```ini
# SDDM Login Panel Custom Graphic Grid Insertion
[Branding]
ThemeName="gNewSense-Evolution"
LogoLeft="/usr/share/sddm/themes/evolution/gnewsense-2006.png"
LogoRight="/usr/share/sddm/themes/evolution/gnewsense-2012.png"
```
